===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# A [[future]] [[existence]] or [[state]].
# Existence after [[death]].
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1712|authorlink=Joseph Addison|first=Joseph|last=Addison|title={{w|Cato, a Tragedy}}|others=act 5, scene 1|passage='Tis the Divinity that stirs within us; / 'Tis Heaven itself that points out an '''hereafter''', / and intimates eternity to man.}}

